So there''s an interesting point to be made now, though. This code could be set because the 파워트레인 제어 모듈(PCM) thinks it''s sending more 연료 to 뱅크 2 injectors but in reality they''re not actually putting out more 연료. So in other words this code could be set due to a fueling problem. Additional possible causes for this code are listed a little further down in this article.
