### What does that mean?
This diagnostic trouble code (DTC) is a generic 파워트레인 code. It is considered generic because it applies to all makes and models of vehicles (1996-newer), although specific repair steps may be slightly different depending on the model. So this 엔진 code article applies to Nissan, Toyota, Chevrolet, Ford, Honda, GMC, Subaru, VW, etc.
P0420 is one of the more common trouble codes that we see. Other popular codes includeP0171,P0300,P0455,P0442, etc. So be sure to bookmark this site for future reference!
The 촉매 컨버터 is a part of the 배기 시스템 that looks kind of like a muffler, although it''s job is very different from that of a muffler. A 촉매 컨버터''s job is to reduce emissions from the 배기.
The 촉매 컨버터 has an 산소 센서 in 전방 and behind it. When the vehicle is warm and running in 닫힘 loop mode, the 상류(Upstream) 산소 센서 waveform reading should fluctuate. The 하류(Downstream) 산소 센서 reading should be fairly steady. Typically theP0420code triggers the 엔진 점검등 Light if the readings of the two sensors are similar. Oxygen sensors are also referred to as 산소 sensors.
This is indicative of (among other things) a 컨버터 that is not working as efficiently as it should be (according to specs). Catalytic converters are not normally a "wear" type item, that is they are not designed to wear out and need replacement. If they have failed, it is likely due to something else that caused it to fail. This is what a P0420 means in simplified terms.

### Symptoms
The main symptom to the 드라이버 is the illumination of the MIL (오작동 indicator lamp). You will likely not notice any drivability problems, although there may be 
  symptoms. For example, if the substance inside the 촉매 컨버터 is broken or failed, it may be restricting the 배기 which will result in a feeling of reduced 전원 출력 from the vehicle.

### Causes
A codeP0420may mean that one or more of the following 
  has happened:
Leaded 연료 was used where unleaded was called for (unlikely)A damaged or failed oxygen / 산소 sensorDownstream 산소 센서 (가열식 산소 센서) wiring damaged or connected improperlyThe 엔진 냉각수 온도 센서 is not working properlyDamaged or leaking 배기 manifold / 촉매 컨버터 / muffler / 배기 pipeFailed or underperforming 촉매 컨버터 (likely)Retarded 스파크 timingThe oxygen sensors in 전방 and behind the 컨버터 are reporting 과도하게 similar 
    of readingsLeaking 연료 인젝터 or 높음 연료 pressureCylinder misfireOil contamination

### Possible Solutions
Some suggested steps for troubleshooting and fixing aP0420오류 
  code include:
Check for 배기 leaks at the manifold, pipes, 촉매 컨버터. Repair 
    as required.Use a scope to diagnose the 산소 센서 operation (Tip: The 산소 센서 
    in 전방 of the 촉매 컨버터 normally has a fluctuating waveform. The 
    waveform of the 센서 behind the 컨버터 should be more steady).Inspect the 하류(Downstream) heated 산소 센서, replace if necessaryReplace the 촉매 컨버터
Generally speaking you CAN 통신 look at the 온도 of the 배기 just before and just after the 컨버터 using an infrared 온도 gun. The 출력 should be about 100 degrees Fahrenheit hotter when the 엔진 is fully warmed up.
Overall probably the biggest mistake vehicles owners make when they have a P0420 code is to simply replace an 산소 센서 (02 센서). It is important to do proper diagnosis so you''re not wasting money replacing parts unnecessarily.
We strongly recommend that if you need to replace the 촉매 컨버터 that you replace it with an original manufacturer brand 유닛 (i.e. get it from a dealership). Second choice would be a 높음-quality replacement part such as a 50-state legal cat. There are many stories in our forums where folks replaced the cat with a cheaper aftermarket one only to have the code return shortly thereafter.
One thing to note is that many vehicle manufacturers offer a longer warranty 
  on emissions-related parts. So if you have a newer car but it''s out of it''s 
  bumper-to-bumper warranty, there still may be warranty on this type of problem. 
  Many manufacturers give a five year, unlimited mileage warranty on these items. 
  It''s worth checking into.
See also:P0420.com- P0420 Help

