### What does that mean?
This diagnostic trouble code (DTC) is a generic 파워트레인 code, which means that it applies to many OBD-II equipped vehicles. Although generic, the specific repair steps may vary depending on make/model. This code is found on many makes including but not limited to Ford, GMC, Jeep, Dodage, Toyota, BMW, Chrysler, Subaru, etc.
The vehicle''s 파워트레인 제어 모듈(PCM) (파워트레인 제어 모듈) tests the 증발 emissions (증발 가스) 시스템 for large and small leaks among other conditions. In the case of this DTC, it indicates a 연료 증기 누출 in the 증발 가스 제어 시스템. It means a very 
  small 누출 has been 감지됨. In fact, the 누출 CAN 통신 be from a hole as small 
  as 0.04" in diameter. The (증발 가스) emission 제어 시스템 prevents the escape 
  of 연료 vapors from a vehicle''s 연료 시스템.
연료 vapors are routed by hoses 
  to a charcoal 캐니스터 for storage. Later, when the 엔진 is running a 퍼지 
  제어 밸브 opens allowing 흡기 진공 to siphon the 연료 vapors into the 
  엔진 to be burned. That results in decreased vehicle emissions.
