The only thing you will notice is the 오작동 Indicator Lamp (MIL) a.k.a. 엔진 점검등 Light will be illuminated. You likely won''t notice any drivability problems although sometimes a 연료 odor may be noticed.

### Causes
A code P0442 most likely means one or more of the following has happened:
A loose or improperly affixed gas capA non-conforming gas 캡 (i.e. not factory/original brand)A small 누출/hole in a 연료 증기 hose/tubeOther small 누출 in 증발 가스 systemFaulty 벤트 o-ring sealDefective 벤트 valveDefective 퍼지 valveDefective 누출 감지 펌프

### Possible Solutions
With a P0442, the most common DIY repair is to:
Remove and reinstall the gas 캡, clear the codes, and 구동 for a day and 
