More advanced troubleshooting steps include:
Using an advanced scan tool, perform an 증발 가스 누출 testVerify operation of the 증발 가스 퍼지 솔레노이드 / valvePerform a smoke 테스트 to see where the 누출 is
Generally there are vehicle and model specific procedures for proper diagnosis of this DTC.
