### What does that mean?
This diagnostic trouble code (DTC) is a generic 파워트레인 code, which means that it applies to OBD-II equipped vehicles. Although generic, the specific repair steps may vary depending on make/model.
P0201 means that the 파워트레인 제어 모듈(PCM) 감지됨 a 결함 in the 인젝터 or the wiring to 
  the 인젝터. It monitors the 인젝터 and when the 인젝터 is activated, the 
  파워트레인 제어 모듈(PCM) expects to see the 전압 pulled "낮음" or close to zero.
When the 인젝터 is switched off, the 파워트레인 제어 모듈(PCM) expects to see a 전압 that is close 
  to 배터리 전압 or "높음". If it doesn''t see the 예상됨 전압 
  the 파워트레인 제어 모듈(PCM) will set this code. The 파워트레인 제어 모듈(PCM) also monitors resitance in the 회로. 
  If the resistance is excessively 낮음 or 높음 it will set this code.Potential SymptomsThe symptoms for this code will likely be a 실화(불발) and a rough running 엔진. 
  Poor acceleration. The MIL will also be illuminated.CausesThe causes could be any of the following:Bad 인젝터. This is usually the cause of this code but doesn''t rule out 
    the possibility of one of the other causesOpen in the wiring to the injectorShort in the wiring to the injectorBad PCMPossible SolutionsFirst, using a DVOM check the resistance of the 인젝터. If it isn''t 
