    if it operates. If the 인젝터 operates, then you likely have either an 단선(Open) 
    in the wiring, or a blocked 인젝터. If you do not have access to a tester, 
    swap the 인젝터 with another one and see if the code changes. If the code 
    changes, then change the 인젝터.At the 파워트레인 제어 모듈(PCM), remove the 드라이버 wire from the 파워트레인 제어 모듈(PCM) 커넥터 and 접지 the 
    wire. (Make sure you have the correct wire. If you''re not sure, do not attempt) 
