불충분 배기가스 재순환(배기가스 재순환(EGR)) (배기가스 재순환(EGR)) 흐름/유량

### What does that mean?
This diagnostic trouble code (DTC) is a generic 파워트레인 code, which means that it applies to OBD-II equipped vehicles. Although generic, the specific repair steps may vary depending on make/model.
배기가스 재순환(EGR) stands for 배기가스 재순환(배기가스 재순환(EGR)). It is part of the vehicle emmissions 
  시스템, and is used to reduce 연소 온도 and 압력 to 제어 
  Oxides of Nitrogen. There are generally three parts to the 배기가스 재순환(EGR) 시스템: the 배기가스 재순환(EGR) 
  밸브, an 액추에이터 솔레노이드, and a 디퍼렌셜 압력 센서 배기가스 재순환(EGR) (DPFE). 
  These things work together to deliver the correct amount of recirculation based 
  on 엔진 온도, 부하, etc. The P0401 code means that OBD 감지됨 an 
  불충분 amount of 배기가스 재순환(EGR).
SymptomsYou may notice drivability problems such as pinging (a.k.a. pre-점화 노킹) when the 엔진 is under 부하 or the vehicle is at higher speeds. There may also be other symptoms.CausesA code P0401 most likely means one or more of the following has happened:The DPFE (디퍼렌셜 압력 feedback 배기가스 재순환(EGR)) 센서 is faulty and needs 
    to be replacedThere is a blockage in the 배기가스 재순환(EGR) (tube), most likely carbon buildupThe 배기가스 재순환(EGR) 밸브 is faultyThe 배기가스 재순환(EGR) 밸브 may not be opening due to a lack of vaccuumPossible SolutionsIn fixing this code, it is quite common for people to just replace the 배기가스 재순환(EGR) 밸브 only to have the OBD code return. The 배기가스 재순환(EGR) 밸브 is not always the culprit.Use a 진공 펌프 and pull the 배기가스 재순환(EGR) 밸브 단선(Open) while monitoring 엔진 RPM''s 
    & DPFE 전압. There should be a noticable difference in RPM''s with the 
    배기가스 재순환(EGR) openClean out the 배기가스 재순환(EGR) 밸브 and/or tubing to remove depositsCheck the 전압 at the DPFE, compare to specified values (refer to a repair 
    manual for your specific model)Replace the DPFE 센서 (with a good quality / OEM one)Replace the 배기가스 재순환(EGR) valveRelated 배기가스 재순환(EGR) codes:P0400,P0402,P0403,P0404,P0405,P0406,P0407,P0408,P0409Related  DTC DiscussionsRegister now to ask a question (free)P0401 on 97 Camry 4-cylGot the P0401 code for the first time a couple months back; disconnected 배터리 to clear code, CEL went out and didn''t come back on for a few weeks (including a 1000 mile round trip). 

