2 times, 2 different brands, same problem. With the egr unbolted from the intake (vac port plugged) I can scope the blue wire and it shows the command to open in steps. I scope the brown wire (return) and it shows the valve opening. A...My 2002 Ford mustang with the P0401 code!!My mustang recently showed up with the check engine light and ", "manufacturer": "Unknown", "dtc_code": "P0401", "source": "github_dtc_summary"}', '531b5bf72094d8e26fe625f6bb0741b6a98d7265c22974d70fbf072cf917af0b') ON CONFLICT (content_hash) DO NOTHING;
