IAC (공회전 공기 제어) 시스템 오작동
This diagnostic trouble code (DTC) is a generic 파워트레인 code, which means that it applies to OBD-II equipped vehicles. Although generic, the specific repair steps may vary depending on make/model.

### What does that mean?
The IAC (공회전 공기 제어) 밸브 controls the 공회전 속도 of the 엔진. At 공회전 the 스로틀 플레이트 is 닫힘, of course. The IAC is computer controlled and allows only a certain amount of 공기 around the 스로틀 플레이트. This metered 공기 controls the 공회전 속도. The IAC has a "plunger" or "shutter" that moves to 단선(Open) or close the 바이패스 공기 passageway.
The more 공기 the IAC allows around the 스로틀 플레이트, the higher the 공회전. The 파워트레인 제어 모듈(PCM) (파워트레인 제어 모듈) uses the IAC 밸브 to keep the 공회전 속도 correct with varying 엔진 demands. CAN 통신 be a three or four wire 센서 depending on the model.The 파워트레인 제어 모듈(PCM) monitors voltages of the IAC circuits and if it detects an incorrect 전압 on one or more of the IAC 모터 circuits it will set P0505. NOTE: Problems with the IAC would only be noticeable at 공회전 or when 스로틀 is 닫힘.SymptomsSymptoms may include:MIL (오작동 Indicator Lamp) illuminationEngine stalls and may not 공회전 unless 스로틀 is depressedIntermittently stalls when letting off the throttleEngine may 공회전 과도하게 highCausesPotential causes of an P0505 code include:IAC 모터 커넥터 is damaged (check 커넥터 and pins for damage, and moisture)One or more IAC circuits 단선(Open) or 단락됨 to groundOne or more IAC circuits are 단락됨 to voltageIAC has failedPCM has failedPossible SolutionsThis should be a fairly straightforward diagnosis. 시작 by clearing the 결함 codes. Then unplug the IAC and 시작 the 엔진 (This may cause other IAC codes to set. Just ignore them for now). If the P0505 code doesn''t 리셋/초기화, replace the IAC. It is internally shorting one of the IAC circuits. If the code DOES return after unplugging the IAC and starting the 엔진, then you know it isn''t the IAC 모터. Visually check the wiring 와이어링/배선 all the way back to the 파워트레인 제어 모듈(PCM). You may need to visually inspect the 와이어링/배선 by removing all the insulation off the wires. It is possible that the wires could be shorting to eachother or to other wires in the 와이어링/배선.If there are no wiring problems, and the code keeps returning with the IAC unplugged, you CAN 통신 check the 파워트레인 제어 모듈(PCM) by removing the IAC wires from the 파워트레인 제어 모듈(PCM) 커넥터 (or clipping the wires in a location where they CAN 통신 be repaired easily) and then 시작 the 엔진 (If you''re not sure, don''t do it. Take it to a qualified professional). Now if the code doesn''t 리셋/초기화 there is a problem with the wiring. Check for continuity on all the IAC wires. Any resistance points to a problem. Check for 전압 on any(At this point there shouldn''t be any voltages on the wires because they''re clipped at one end and unplugged at the IAC). Repair as necessary. But if the P0505 code DOES 리셋/초기화 after removing the IAC wires from the 파워트레인 제어 모듈(PCM) 커넥터 (or clipping them), replace the 파워트레인 제어 모듈(PCM), there''s a problem internally on the IAC 제어 회로.Other related DTCs:P0506,P0507Related  DTC DiscussionsRegister now to ask a question (free)P0505 2001 MaximaHas anyone had this problem and did you discover that it was the 공회전 공기 제어 밸브 or something else. Please tell me your experience. Thanks for any help. DB...2001 dodge ram 2500 5.9L p0505 HELP!!Same code keep popping up. I cleaned 스로틀 바디, tried replacing iac, nothing so i put old one back. Btw resistance in both 모터 winding on old iac is about 53.8 ohms, is that normal? Ram new writing from iac to 파워트레인 제어 모듈(PCM) still code come up leaving only the 파워트레인 제어 모듈(PCM). Any ideass on how to 테스트 파워트레인 제어 모듈(PCM) with mult...2001 Jeep Grand Cherokee, P0505,P0302Need some help with a 2001 Grand Cherokee.  It overheated last week, was shut down to let cool.  When restarted there was a loud 노킹.  I pulled 밸브 cover and found #5 배기 rocker arm laying inside.  I reinstalled the rocker arm, and 밸브 cover.  Restarted 엔진 lound 노킹 gone but now ther...2001 Nissan Pathfinder 3.5L P1145 P0505 P0304Hello my name is Jesse. I have a Nissan Pathfinder SE 2001 it has 우측 at 196800 miles. I''m having several issues. P1145 P0505 P0304. I have changed 공회전 공기 제어 밸브. I have changed the cam 센서. I have pulled the plugs. I have checked the electric connections. I''m at my wit''s end on this c...2002 Honda Accord P0505 and P1519I am having problems. I get codes PO505 and P1519. I changed my iac and still get codes.  It said this might be the problem (IAC 밸브 제어 회로 is 단선(Open) or 단락됨 to 시스템 전원). Does this mean to check the wireing where it connects at iac.  the 엔진 races up and down. When I 구동 it whe...P0505 and P0600 codes-1996 dodge stratusThis is on a 1996 Dodge Stratus.
