  other symptoms as well. Of course, when trouble codes are set, the MIL (오작동 
  indicator lamp, a.k.a. the 엔진 점검등 light) illuminates.CausesA P0507 DTC trouble code may be caused by one or more of the following:A 진공 leakLeaking 공기 흡기 after the 스로틀 bodyEGR 밸브 leaking vacuumA faulty positive crankcase ventilation (PCV) valveDamaged/failed/dirty 스로틀 bodyFailed 증발 가스 systemFailed IAC (공회전 공기 controller) or faulty IAC circuitPossible SolutionsThis DTC is more of an informational code, so if there are any other codes 
