### What does that mean?
This diagnostic trouble code (DTC) is a generic 파워트레인 code, which means that it applies to OBD-II equipped vehicles. Although generic, the specific repair steps may vary depending on make/model.
This code is a fairly simple one. It basically means that the 파워트레인 제어 모듈(PCM)/엔진 제어 모듈(ECM) (파워트레인/엔진 제어 모듈) has 감지됨 an internal integrity 결함 in the 파워트레인 제어 모듈(PCM).
When this code is activated it should store freeze-frame 데이터 that helps someone with an advanced code scanning tool to get information on exactly what was going on with the vehicle when the P0606 code was triggered.SymptomsMost likely the only symptom of a P0606 DTC code is the illumination of the "엔진 점검등 Light" a.k.a. MIL (오작동 Indicator Lamp).Photo of a 파워트레인 제어 모듈(PCM) with the cover removed:CausesIn all likelyhood the 파워트레인 제어 모듈(PCM) / 엔진 제어 모듈(ECM) has failed.Possible SolutionsAs a vehicle owner there is little you CAN 통신 do to fix this code. The most common fix for a P0606 code is to replace the 파워트레인 제어 모듈(PCM), although in some cases re-flashing the 파워트레인 제어 모듈(PCM) with updated software could possibly fix this. Be sure to check for TSB''s on your vehicle (Technical Service Bulletins).In all likelyhood the fix is to replace the 파워트레인 제어 모듈(PCM). This is generally not a "do-it-yourself" task, although in some cases it may be. We strongly recommend you have a qualified repair shop / technician do the work, one that has the capability to reprogram the new 파워트레인 제어 모듈(PCM). Installing the new 파워트레인 제어 모듈(PCM) may involve using special tools to program the vehicle''s VIN (vehicle identification number) and/or anti-theft information (PATS, etc.).NOTE: This repair may be covered under the emissions warranty so be sure to check with your dealer as this may be covered beyond the bumper-to-bumper or 파워트레인 warranty period.Other 파워트레인 제어 모듈(PCM) DTC codes:P0600,P0601,P0602,P0603,P0604,P0605,P0607, P0608, P0609, P0610.Related  DTC DiscussionsRegister now to ask a question (free)2006 Lexus GS300 ''P0606'' with ''C1201'' issues...Hi guys, I''m 고착됨 with an issue that is happening to my 2006 Lexus GS300. It is a GRS190 model and 엔진 is a 3GR V6 유닛. Mileage is now coming to 92,000km.After starting the vehicle at times, the MIL light together with VSC and TRC light comes on. It''ll disappear at times after shutting off and ...Ford focus 2010 tdci P0606A would really like some h