I cleared...Ford Fiesta 2013 P0606I have a 결함 code (P0606) on my car. What should I do?...Ford Fiesta P0606Alguém saberia me dizer qual o diagnóstico do cód de falha P0606 em um Ford fiesta 1.6 16 모터 Sigma???...2007 Toyota Rav4 code P0606my toyota rav4, 2007 of recent having delay up to 5-10 minutes before drivinig. after scan its show a code of P0606. what could be the cause.?...GMC Terrain 2013-OBD CODE P0700/P0606I am getting 엔진 점검등 light, scanner shows code of P0700 and P0606. I believe it is now in the limp mode to prevent damage to the 변속기. One mechanic told me that he will follow the codes and replace the 센서 (P0606) while the GMC mechanic told me he will charge me $1100.00 to', '{"original_en": "### OBD-II DTC Technical Description\nPCM / ECM Processor Fault\n\n### What does that mean?\nThis diagnostic trouble code (DTC) is a generic powertrain code, which means that it applies to OBD-II equipped vehicles. Although generic, the specific repair steps may vary depending on make/model.\nThis code is a fairly simple one. It basically means that the PCM/ECM (powertrain/engine control module) has detected an internal integrity fault in the PCM.\nWhen this code is activated it should store freeze-frame data that helps someone with an advanced code scanning tool to get information on exactly what was going on with the vehicle when the P0606 code was triggered.SymptomsMost likely the only symptom of a P0606 DTC code is the illumination of the \"Check Engine Light\" a.k.a. MIL (Malfunction Indicator Lamp).Photo of a PCM with the cover removed:CausesIn all likelyhood the PCM / ECM has failed.Possible SolutionsAs a vehicle owner there is little you can do to fix this code. The most common fix for a P0606 code is to replace the PCM, although in some cases re-flashing the PCM with updated software could possibly fix this. Be sure to check for TSB''s on your vehicle (Technical Service Bulletins).In all likelyhood the fix is to replace the PCM. This is generally not a \"do-it-yourself\" task, although in some cases it may be. We strongly recommend you have a qualified repair shop / technician do the work, one that has the capability to reprogram the new PCM. Installing the new PCM may involve using special tools to program the vehicle''s VIN (vehicle identification number) and/or anti-theft information (PATS, etc.).NOTE: This repair may be covered under the emissions warranty so be sure to check with your dealer as this may be covered beyond the bumper-to-bumper or powertrain warranty period.Other PCM DTC codes:P0600,P0601,P0602,P0603,P0604,P0605,P0607, P0608, P0609, P0610.Related  DTC DiscussionsRegister now to ask a question (free)2006 Lexus GS300 ''P0606'' with ''C1201'' issues...Hi guys, I''m stuck with an issue that is happening to my 2006 Lexus GS300. It is a GRS190 model and engine is a 3GR V6 unit. Mileage is now coming to 92,000km.After starting the vehicle at times, the MIL light together with VSC and TRC light comes on. It''ll disappear at times after shutting off and ...Ford focus 2010 tdci P0606A would really like some help if possible got this fault code on car has anybody else experienced this problem if so what was the fix an solution....?...P0606 error code 2006 Mitsubishi coltHi. I have a Mitsubishi colt cz1 1.1 l petrol 2006 and i have the code P0606 can i reset it or i need to change the ECU. And if so can i change only the ECU or i need the whole kit? Thank you....2004 Ford F150 FX4 5.4 P0606 P2106 P0345I have a 2004 F150 Fx4 with the 5.4 motor. it has 183k miles. I changed the timing chains and tensioners. put it all back together now im getting 3 codes. P0606 pcm processor fault. P2106 throttle actuator limited power, and P0345 camshaft position sensor circuit failure. Can someone tell me what al...Land rover freelander 2002 codes p0171, p0174, p0606, p1319My land rover freelander 2002 with light on service engine soon indicated trouble codes p0171, p0174, p0606, p1319 on mv inspection. Mileage 73000....Audi A4 P0606 P0638 P0642 Stabilisation Control (ESC) FaultIt''s Audi A4 1.8 2012 model.this car start then shutdown immediately. Stabilisation Control (ESC) Fault! See owner''s manual. i try to use OBD2 scan tool so there is the code found.( P0642 )sensor reference voltage A Circuit low ,( P0606 ) ECM/PCM processor and P0638 Throttle Autuator Control Range/P...Chevy Captiva P0606Chevy Captiva 2007 ls 2.4 code p0606...GMC ENVOY 2004 P0606I have a GMC ENVOY 2004 and the P0606 engine code came on today. It says it is the PCM/ECM (powertrain/engine control module) that is causing this code to trip. Does any one know how much it would cost to get a new PCM/ECM MODULE ?  I live in Oshawa, Ontario, CANADA....2008 Saturn Vue P06062008 Saturn Vue, 40K, V6, auto.\nThis code has came up 3 times (so far)\nAbout 6 weeks ago we started the car and it sounded rough, missing, pinging, and would hardly run.\nI scaned it and retrieved a P0606, PCM processor fault.\nI started the car several times and the problem was still there.\nI cleared...Ford Fiesta 2013 P0606I have a fault code (P0606) on my car. What should I do?...Ford Fiesta P0606Alguém saberia me dizer qual o diagnóstico do cód de falha P0606 em um Ford fiesta 1.6 16 motor Sigma???...2007 Toyota Rav4 code P0606my toyota rav4, 2007 of recent having delay up to 5-10 minutes before drivinig. after scan its show a code of P0606. what could be the cause.?...GMC Terrain 2013-OBD CODE P0700/P0606I am getting check engine light, scanner shows code of P0700 and P0606. I believe it is now in the limp mode to prevent damage to the transmission. One mechanic told me that he will follow the codes and replace the sensor (P0606) while the GMC mechanic told me he will charge me $1100.00 to ", "manufacturer": "Unknown", "dtc_code": "P0606", "source": "github_dtc_summary"}', '70d2c3d74ace8aa89a245601b7a88894eef1e059bf7fde4dd6ed921015d137fa') ON CONFLICT (content_hash) DO NOTHING;
